    "ok": true,
    "answerability": "partial",
    "answerText": "Summary\nIf you configure and assign a Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to the user, Teams checks the userΓÇÖs outgoing calls against the Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to determine whether their dialed number matches a number-pattern that you've defined in the online voice-routing policy.\n\nIf you configure and assign a Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to the user, Teams checks the userΓÇÖs outgoing calls against the Direct Routing online voice-routing policy to determine whether their dialed number matches a number-pattern that you've defined in the online voice-routing policy.\n\nCaveats / limitations\nOnly supported portions should be answered.\n\nMissing authoritative domain coverage: teams_powershell\n\nSources\nPlanning Teams dial plans for Teams Phone ΓÇö https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoftteams/dial-plans-routing-overview",
